  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Coordination on Inclusion of Third Country Nationals in Slovakia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to creating prerequisites for a better cooperation within the integration infrastructure in Slovakia and supporting the access to services, while taking into account TCNs&#x2019; needs. It sets the scene for the development of the reform of the framework in the integration area and the establishment of a multi-sectoral coordination mechanism at national and local level, and thus support the integration/inclusion of TCNs in Slovakia. It will help Slovakia to implement short-term integration/inclusion structures, processes and coordination mechanisms necessary for organizing a coherent and coordinated response towards the influx of persons fleeing Ukraine, as well as planning for more consistent long-term integration measures, while developing institutional capacities necessary for the provision of relevant services (accommodation, education, healthcare, social security, access to employment, culture and community) and enhancing the coordination between relevant stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
